"Ring of the Enderman": {
  "index": 1,
  "category": "artifice",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Ring of the Enderman"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "After studying the capabilities of Endermen, I have devised a recipe for a ring that will "
        },
        {
          "text": "enhance my blink spells to teleport me to where the shape targets",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " instead of forward. \n\nWhen teleporting in this way, the effective range of my blink spell is also doubled. \n\nIf I target air, it will function as the default spell, teleporting me forward.\n\nIf I target a creature, I will be teleported behind that creature.\n\nThis ring, similar to the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring of the Skies, ",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "will also allow me to cast more times in the air before needing to touch the ground."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "manaweaving_altar",
      "location": "mna:manaweaving/artifice/blink_precision_ring"
    }
  ]
}